<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/3U4XXUHD> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/BBA26ch5>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/BBA26ch6> ;
    ipbes:Report <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/BBA26> ;
